# Design system (DESIGN.md)

Before generating or editing **any visual UI**, read `DESIGN.md` at the project root.

## Required

- Use **only** colors, spacing, radius, and typography from `DESIGN.md`.
- Flutter: import `flutter_app/lib/theme/app_design_system.dart` — use `AppColors`, `AppFonts`, `AppRadii`, `AppSpacing`, `buildAppTheme()`.
- Web: use CSS variables from `src/app/globals.css` (`--wy-*`).
- Primary brand blue is `#2A72E5` (icon), **not** `#7EAFD9`, `#007BFF`, violet `#7C6FF7`, or Material `#2563EB`.
- Body font **SUIT**; display titles **IBM Plex Sans KR**.
- **Light theme** — scaffold `#EEF3F8`, cards `#FFFFFF`.

## Voice

- Home: first visit 「오늘은 한 장만…」 + **숙제 올리기**; returning 「어제 막힌 곳부터…」 + **이어서 풀기**.
- Prefer 숙제 / 찍기 / 막힌 곳 / 이어서 풀기. Avoid AI·인사이트·대시보드 카피.

## Patterns

- Cards: white surface, light border, elevation 0 (or soft glass only on tab/app bar).
- One primary filled CTA per screen; secondary actions outlined or text.
- CTA: solid `{colors.primary}` + white label.

## Forbidden

- Dark scaffold colors (`#09090F`, slate-950, `#0F172A`).
- Legacy primaries `#7EAFD9`, `#007BFF`, violet `#7C6FF7`, Material `#2563EB`.
- Noto Sans KR as the default UI face (use SUIT / IBM).
- Leading home with 「오늘 어떤문제를…」, 「중1 맞춤」, 「최근 분석」.
